# Module:           editors/tree-sitter-nurt/.gitignore
# Responsibility:   Paths of the tree-sitter grammar that Git does not track.
# Dependencies:     none
# Author:           Danaco Official
# Version:          0.1.1, 2026-11-27
# License:          see the LICENSE file or https://www.danaco-group.pl

# Parser sources are generated by `tree-sitter generate` and are not tracked.
/src/*
!/src/scanner.c
/variant-b/src/*
!/variant-b/src/scanner.c
/variant-c/src/*
!/variant-c/src/scanner.c

